:: StoryInit
/% 游戏数据在“开始这一天”时初始化；开始菜单没有地点。 %/
<<set $hero to "Author">>

:: Start
<<set $demo_screen to "menu">>
<<print "Narrava · 小镇的一天" {heading: 1}>>
<<print "A Day in Town · Narrava Loom Demo" 3 "small">><br>
雨云停在海边。熟悉的街道，重新写成一段可以选择的生活。<br>
在旅舍醒来，去街上谋生，或沿小路走进森林。<br>
<<link [[新的一天|NewGame]]>><</link>><br>
<<button [[读取小镇存档|Start]]>><<run importSave("town-day")>><</button>><br>
<<link [[作者手册 · 全能力示例|Hall]]>><</link>>

:: Bar
<<barDemo>>

:: BarStowed
<<barStowedDemo>>

:: Header
<<audio "chime.wav" "ambience" "forest">>

:: NewGame
<<set $demo_screen to "menu">>
<<print "你将怎样度过今天？" {heading: 1}>>
姓名：<<textbox "$town_name" "Alex">><br>
世界种子：<<textbox "$town_seed" "town-morning">><br>
相同种子与相同行动会得到相同的探索结果。<br>
<<set $town_hints to $town_hints ?? true>>
<<set $town_route to $town_route ?? "work">>
显示行动提示：<<checkbox "$town_hints" false true>><br>
今日打算：<<radiobutton "$town_route" "work">> 先挣一份工钱
<<radiobutton "$town_route" "explore">> 先去城外走走<br>
<<button [[开始这一天|Bedroom]]>><<run townBegin()>><</button>><br>
<<link [[返回菜单|Start]]>><</link>>

:: Bedroom [guesthouse inside]
<<print "你的卧室" {heading: 1}>>
窗帘透进灰白的晨光，桌上放着一本空白日记。楼下已经有人在打扫。<br>
<<print $town.notice 3>><br>
<<if $town_hints>>
<<if $town_route == "explore">>
今天想去森林走走。先看看地图；雨衣能让探索轻松一些。<br>
<<else>>
今天想先赚工钱。钟楼咖啡馆八点开门，每天可以做两次短班。<br>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<link [[下楼找 林澈|Guesthouse]]>><</link>><br>
<<button [[睡到明早|Bedroom]]>><<run townAct("rest")>><</button>><br>
<<set $town_return to "Bedroom">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: Guesthouse [guesthouse inside]
<<print "旅舍 · 公共休息室" {heading: 1}>>
林澈蹲在一台旧收音机旁，把螺丝按大小排成一行。<br>
<<if $town.quest == "available">>
“购物中心还有这种零件。你能帮我带一包回来吗？”<br>
<<button [[接下委托|Guesthouse]]>><<run townAct("accept")>><</button>><br>
<<elseif $town.quest == "accepted" && $town.parcels == 0>>
零件售价 £8；带回来后林澈会付你 £15。<br>
<<elseif $town.quest == "accepted">>
你把纸袋放到桌上，林澈眼睛一亮。<br>
<<button [[交付零件|DeliveryDone]]>><<run townAct("deliver")>><</button>><br>
<<else>>
收音机传出断断续续的音乐。“今天多亏了你。”<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[走出大门|ResidentialStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回卧室|Bedroom]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "Guesthouse">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: DeliveryDone [guesthouse inside]
<<print "一件小事，也值得记下来" {heading: 1}>>
<<print $town.notice>><br>
<<townWait>><br>
<<link [[继续这一天|Guesthouse]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "DeliveryDone">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: DeliveryNotice
日记新增：我和林澈修好了一台收音机。<br>

:: ResidentialStreet [residential_street outside]
<<print "住宅街" {heading: 1}>>
一排相似的小屋沿道路展开。有人在照顾门前的花园，赶路的人撑起雨伞。<br>
<<link [[穿过街口，去商业区|MarketStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[走向森林入口|ForestEdge]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[进入旅舍|Guesthouse]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "ResidentialStreet">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: MarketStreet [market_street outside]
<<print "商业街" {heading: 1}>>
购物中心的橱窗倒映着行人。巷口飘来咖啡香，医院的指示牌就在街道另一端。<br>
<<if !townOpen()>>
<<print "店铺已经打烊。可以去医院休息，或回家睡到明早。" 24>><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[购物中心|ShoppingCentre]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[钟楼咖啡馆|ClockCafe]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[医院|TownHospital]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[公园|TownPark]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回住宅街|ResidentialStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "MarketStreet">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: ClockCafe [clock_cafe inside]
<<print "钟楼咖啡馆" {heading: 1}>>
你透过窗边高座看向街道，闻到现磨咖啡的香气。<br>
<<print $town.notice 3>><br>
<<if townOpen()>>
<<if $town.energy >= 25 && $town.shifts < 2>>
<<button [[帮工两小时 · +£18 / -25 体力|ClockCafe]]>><<run townAct("work")>><</button>><br>
<<else>>
今天先歇一歇吧；工作需要 25 体力，每天最多两班。<br>
<</if>>
<<if $town.money >= 4>>
<<button [[窗边喝拿铁 · £4 / 20 分钟|ClockCafe]]>><<run townAct("coffee")>><</button>><br>
<</if>>
<<else>>
椅子已经收起，明天八点再来吧。<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[走回商业街|MarketStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "ClockCafe">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: ShoppingCentre [shopping_centre inside]
<<print "购物中心" {heading: 1}>>
服装柜台和杂货铺共用一间明亮的大厅。<br>
<<print $town.notice 3>><br>
<<if townOpen()>>
<<if $town.quest == "accepted" && $town.parcels == 0 && $town.money >= 8>>
<<button [[购买收音机零件 · £8|ShoppingCentre]]>><<run townAct("parcel")>><</button>><br>
<</if>>
<<if !$town.coat && $town.money >= 12>>
<<button [[购买雨衣 · £12|ShoppingCentre]]>><<run townAct("coat")>><</button>><br>
<</if>>
<<if $town.coat>>
雨衣已经装进你的背包。<br>
<</if>>
<<else>>
店员已经拉下了卷帘门。<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[离开购物中心|MarketStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "ShoppingCentre">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: TownHospital [town_hospital inside]
<<print "医院 · 接待处" {heading: 1}>>
走廊里很安静。值班人员指了指饮水机和休息区。<br>
<<print $town.notice 3>><br>
<<if $town.money >= 5>>
<<button [[补给与休息 · £5 / 30 分钟|TownHospital]]>><<run townAct("clinic")>><</button>><br>
<</if>>
<<button [[走到窗边等候区|TownHospital]]>><<run locationMoveTo(-60, 65)>><</button>><br>
<<link [[走到院外|HospitalOutside]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "TownHospital">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: HospitalOutside [town_hospital outside]
你站在医院门口，同一个地点从 inside 切换为 outside。<br>
<<locationCurrent>><br>
<<link [[返回接待处|TownHospital]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回商业街|MarketStreet]]>><</link>>

:: TownPark [town_park outside]
<<crossFileCard "留一点时间给自己。">><br>
<<print "公园" {heading: 1}>>
河岸的郁金香随风晃动。你在长椅上展开地图，暂时离开街道的喧闹。<br>
<<link [[回商业街|MarketStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "TownPark">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: ForestEdge [forest_edge outside forest]
<<print "森林入口" {heading: 1}>>
房屋逐渐稀疏，泥土小径伸入树荫。木牌提醒你天黑前返回。<br>
<<link [[沿路标深入|ForestTrail]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回住宅街|ResidentialStreet]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "ForestEdge">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: ForestTrail [forest_trail outside forest]
<<print "林间小径" {heading: 1}>>
枝叶在头顶交错。每一次探索耗时半小时，沿途会遇见不同的小事。<br>
<<print $town.notice>><br>
<<if $town.energy >= 15 || ($town.coat && $town.energy >= 10)>>
<<button [[探索半小时|ForestTrail]]>><<run townAct("explore")>><</button>><br>
<<else>>
你已经很累了。先返回镇上恢复体力吧。<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[沿原路返回|ForestEdge]]>><</link>><br>
<<set $town_return to "ForestTrail">>
<<include "TownMenu">>

:: ForestClosed [forest_edge outside forest]
天色已经暗下来。你在路标前停步，决定明天再来。<br>
<<link [[返回住宅街|ResidentialStreet]]>><</link>>

:: TownMenu
<br>
<<link "人物与日记">>
<<dialog "人物">>
<<page "人物">>
<<print $town.name {heading: 2}>><br>
<<meter "体力" $town.energy 0 100>>
<<meter "压力" $town.stress 0 100>>
金钱：£<<print $town.money>><br>
<<page "背包">>
<<print ($town.coat ? "雨衣：探索消耗 10 体力。" : "日常便服：探索消耗 15 体力。")>><br>
零件包：<<print $town.parcels>><br>
<<page "日记">>
<<print $town.notice>><br>
委托状态：<<print $town.quest>><br>
<<page "地图">>
住宅街 → 商业街 → 商场 / 咖啡馆 / 医院 / 公园<br>
住宅街 → 森林入口 → 林间小径<br>
<</dialog>>
<</link>>
 · <<button [[地图与坐标|TownMap]]>><</button>> ·
<<button [[存档与设置|TownSettings]]>><</button>>

:: TownMap
<<print "小镇导览" {heading: 1}>>
<<locationCurrent>><br>
坐标采用同一个平面，西侧使用负值。地点不是地图图片上的像素。<br>
住宅街 [-300, 0] → 商业街 [-110, 0]<br>
旅舍 [-310, 10]；商场 [-95, 15]；咖啡馆 [-160, -10]；医院 [-70, 60]<br>
森林入口 [-460, 0] → 林间小径 [-550, 0]<br>
<<link [[收起地图|TownReturn]]>><</link>>

:: TownReturn
<<goto $town_return>>

:: TownSettings
<<print "日记夹页 · 存档与设置" {heading: 1}>>
保存的是这段旅程的状态、地点、随机序列和 Reaction 次数。<br>
<<button [[保存小镇进度|TownSettings]]>><<run exportSave("town-day")>><</button>><br>
<<button [[读取小镇进度|TownSettings]]>><<run importSave("town-day")>><</button>><br>
提示：<<checkbox "$town_hints" false true>><br>
<<button [[English · 翻译示例|TownSettings]]>><<run selectLanguage("en")>><</button>> ·
<<button [[简体中文|TownSettings]]>><<run selectLanguage("zh-CN")>><</button>><br>
英文包展示本页与部分手册条目的翻译；完整剧情目前使用中文。<br>
<<link [[继续旅程|TownReturn]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[作者手册|Hall]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回到开始菜单|Start]]>><</link>>
